**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
# .git is intentionally included so the builder stage can run `git lfs pull`
# and smudge LFS-tracked GLBs (web/public/assets/gltf/**/*.glb). Without this,
# Coolify clones that don't fetch LFS ship ~130-byte pointer stubs to the
# runner image and R3F loaders fail at runtime.
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# C# build artefacts (WASM stage rebuilds from source)
**/bin
**/obj

# Desktop / server game targets — not needed for web Docker build
src/Forge.Server

# Local dev caches
**/.pnpm-store
